{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OID4VCWallet is the wallet side of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for iOS 16 and macOS 13 and later. It handles SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credentials:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Receiving"}]},{"type":"text","text":" them from a Credential Offer (OpenID4VCI 1.0, HAIP 1.0),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Presenting"}]},{"type":"text","text":" them in answer to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iOS document provider ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the"},{"type":"text","text":